793
00:34:26,000 --> 00:34:28,219
You can do all kinds of interesting network surgery

794
00:34:28,219 --> 00:34:29,139
on that.

795
00:34:29,139 --> 00:34:31,420
And then you'll train the second network

796
00:34:31,420 --> 00:34:34,659
to resolve some parameters, W prime and beta prime.

797
00:34:34,659 --> 00:34:36,159
And this is often called fine-tuning

798
00:34:36,159 --> 00:34:40,699
because we assume the W prime is just a minor modification of W,

799
00:34:40,699 --> 00:34:44,820
because we only fine-tune it on a little bit of data.

800
00:34:44,820 --> 00:34:50,540
So the point here is a lot of people

801
00:34:50,540 --> 00:34:52,300
