00:34:52,300 --> 00:34:54,179
do when you have a ton of data.

803
00:34:54,179 --> 00:34:56,500
But I think the real point of deep learning

804
00:34:56,500 --> 00:34:58,220
is it's the thing you do that enables

805
00:34:58,220 --> 00:35:00,140
