806
00:35:00,140 --> 00:35:01,900
So deep nets and deep learning, to me,

807
00:35:01,900 --> 00:35:04,460
is really all about how to learn from little data.

808
00:35:04,460 --> 00:35:06,340
And the way you learn from little data

809
00:35:06,340 --> 00:35:08,280
