810
00:35:08,280 --> 00:35:10,340
So, yes, you have to pre-train on massive data,

811
00:35:10,340 --> 00:35:13,080
but once you do, you get a very sample efficient method,

812
00:35:13,080 --> 00:35:15,560
which is just update the representation a little bit

813
00:35:15,560 --> 00:35:17,000
to solve the new task.

814
00:35:17,000 --> 00:35:21,840
And this is the best known way right now for a lot of problems

815
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,765
to do learning from little data.

816
00:35:23,765 --> 00:35:25,140
To do, learning from little data,

817
00:35:25,140 --> 00:35:27,882
you have to pre-train on massive data.

