00:40:34,970 --> 00:40:37,730
But you don't just want your representation to be compact.

932
00:40:37,730 --> 00:40:39,570
You also want it to be explanatory.

933
00:40:39,570 --> 00:40:42,650
And one of the technical terms for this is sufficient.

