00:40:44,990 --> 00:40:47,390
Minimal, they're very low-dimensional or

936
00:40:47,390 --> 00:40:49,510
low-information, but sufficient, that they

937
00:40:49,510 --> 00:40:51,770
are sufficient statistics for solving your tasks.

938
00:40:51,770 --> 00:40:54,430
They actually are informative toward the tasks of interest

939
00:40:54,430 --> 00:40:55,770
that you care about.

